sh the system, potentially leading to data loss or corruption. Therefore, I assess the integrity impact as **H** (High).\n\n**Availability Impact (A):**\nThe vulnerability has a high availability impact, as it can cause a denial-of-service or crash the system, potentially leading to system downtime or unavailability. Therefore, I assess the availability impact as **H** (High).\n\n**Vector String:**\nBased on the above assessments, the vector string is:\n```\nCVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:H\n```\n\n**Base Score:**\nUsing the CVSS v3.1 base metric formula, I calculate the base score as follows:\n\n* Attack Vector (AV): 0.87\n* Attack Complexity (AC): 2.9\n* Privileges Required (PR): 0.85\n* User Interaction (UI): 0.85\n* Scope (S): 0.87\n* Confidentiality Impact (C): 0.85\n* Integrity Impact (I): 3.67\n* Availability Impact (A): 3.67\n\nBase Score: 7.42\n\n**Output:**\nThe output is a single JSON object with the following format:\n```json\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"N\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"H\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"N\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"N\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:H\",\n  \"base_score\": 7.42\n}\n```\nNote that the output only includes the required fields and does not include any explanations or additional information.",
